<title>USA: Smith Barney wins San Francisco Redevelopment.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins San Francisco Redevelopment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it won a $29 million San Francisco Redevelopment Financing Authority 1996 Series B tax allocation revenue bond issue, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.754 percent.</p>
</text>
